scular imaging; IQR, interquartile range. Note: Pattern percentages are calculated only within MI-positive lesions (<italic toggle="yes">n</italic> = 68); <italic toggle="yes">p</italic>-value from Mann&#x02013;Whitney U test. Lesion characteristics and microvascular imaging (MI) outcomes.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>